  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8e9c4ee2d087d04d9b8cdf89c4f21bd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lore2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_2
  title: The Moon & The Mountain
  fullText: 'I feel like I have been here before.

    The sea keeps returning me
    here.


    Different shores.

    Different ruins.


    Yet always the same
    moon.

    Always the same mountain with the clouds.


    I have crossed islands
    drowned in fog before.

    Seen skeletons wander shores they no longer remember.


    Something
    awaits...

    Deep in the fog.


    If you come here again...

    Try to Remember.'
